      "content": "hi, i need help with a timeline for the opening ceremony of a 3-day medical symposium in geneva. i need to account for everything from the arrival of the keynote speakers to the AV testing and the catering setup for the welcome breakfast. can you draft a minute-by-minute schedule for the first 3 hours of day 1? i want to make sure nothing gets overlooked so the start is seamless.",
